// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P236224199" "If I were you, I'd run."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P963681941" "Excellent, reinforcements."
