// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P3031885738" "We've got to get these people to safety, cover our retreat!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P4247118575" "Better late than never!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P2404226667" "Ha! We'll make quick work of these D.U.S.T. now!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P3043264724" "It would appear that the tide has turned in our favor."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P719895756" "This will be the end of you!"

// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P1995284539" "Your quest of vengeance ends here!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P3175356775" "The will of the Furies will avail you naught."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P1346015995" "I too follow a higher calling!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P3899293116" "Their thirst of violence is overwhelming!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P1932096803" "Sisters of Fury, your rage will gain you nothing!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P2437996723" "Argh! The air reeks of their hatred!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P767475736" "I can feel their bloodthirst in my bones."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P1938737964" "Too close to their anger, it is overpowering!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P1147527517" "No! Must...strike them down!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P2449491542" "Return to the Well, Sisters of Fury, your time has not yet come!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P2034287490" "Your ancient hatreds will only bring darkness."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P53632975" "This is not the Way!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P686911136" "For too long have you longed to bring death to this world, we are here to end it."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_ALERTED :
"P1094781343" "Help us! Together we can destroy them!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_ALERTED :
"P471876704" "Prepare to die, Talons!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_ALERTED :
"P1450042311" "Ha! We'll make quick work of these Talons now!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_ALERTED :
"P1931159821" "Good, these ones will draw the Talons away!"

// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2069217919" "Such insanity! They reek of it!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P279488787" "What could be the source of such madness?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P263619337" "Their minds are as slippery as eels, there is no place to latch on!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3298397388" "I can feel their madness whispering to me, I must fight it!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2340317620" "There is no talking to them, we must rid the world of their disease."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3361785674" "They are like a disease, we cannot let them escape!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P4293287693" "We cannot let their madness spread!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P4153337940" "I can feel their thoughts slipping past my defenses! I cannot last much longer!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3785450240" "Argh! Their madness, like dirty fingers in my mind!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3216594583" "They're in my thoughts! Like a knife in the dark!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2745580231" "How can one stand against such mindless hate?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P664479231" "I shall put you down like a feral beast!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P169492528" "I can feel your pain, let me end your misery."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_ALERTED :
"P103271311" "Your madness ends here!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_ALERTED :
"P353067775" "Ha! We'll make quick work of these Awakened together!"

// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P3166566671" "Stay still, let my power do the work."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P329408754" "You will feel the pain ebb, soon you will be well again."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P1030061760" "Quiet, let me do my work."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P735498838" "Easy there, you have been injured."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P1575856389" "I am here to help."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P836239087" "Rest easy, you are in good hands now."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P2870883779" "They've suffered severe injuries, but my power should restore them."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P2996970456" "I do not know, there was a lot of damage, but I think I can heal them."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P4085973640" "Hm, four broken ribs, bruised spleen, minor internal bleeding."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P3309842843" "Don't disturb me while I'm working."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P1915441835" "Make sure there are no more hostiles, I have to keep this person stable."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P3273701087" "I'm almost done here, just keep the area clear."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P349093025" "My healing is nearly complete."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P1542857217" "Thank you for getting here in time, I didn't know if my power would have been enough."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P100175844" "My wards will keep the Apparitions at bay. The others...I am not so sure."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2716512605" "Do not disturb me while I work."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P3725634296" "These wards need to be reinforced."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2910000799" "Hm....something is testing my defenses."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P231536257" "I can feel a...presence in the Night Ward...something powerful."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P342929788" "La luce protegge...le guide chiarea il senso...contro la nerezza."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2888296898" "The power of darkness grows, our defenses grow weaker."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3719109768" "The darkness approaches!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P806370312" "Do not let them through!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P516153872" "Get back! Something is trying to get through!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1997016856" "Sisters, brothers! Our enemy approaches!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1366206129" "Enemies at the gate!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3203610060" "Get the innocent to safety, now!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1720322616" "Why did we not foresee this?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1252683176" "Must...keep...them...back!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3625779387" "Power...straining...must maintain defenses!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P2735493021" "To arms!"

// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P3082648007" "The light protects. The light guides. In the depths of darkness, the Light shows The Way."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P3617765613" "From the darkness of fear, we are the way to peace. From the shadows of despair, we are the glimmer of hope. The light of our minds rends the shrouds of ignorance."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P147312672" "Luce...pace...destino...dovere."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P1944204149" "Who interrupts our sacred convocation?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P2481334293" "Who dares?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P2656340145" "What is this disturbance?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P3556369415" "The ritual is interrupted."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3618729661" "We can all feel it, something powerful is gathering in the shadows. It is not of the Well. It is not of Praetoria. It is ancient, elusive, and powerful."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3985362411" "Brothers and sisters; the shadows draw near, and we must be prepared. We must not shrink from this challenge."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3452150446" "The people of Eltentown need us, even if they do not fully trust us. We are their last line of defense."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P626641916" "The people of Eltentown serve a vital role in our plans here, they must be protected, but as regrettable as it may be they can never learn what that purpose is."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P672819373" "We have felt a growing evil in the Forbidden Crags, an ancient evil driven by a lust for vengeance. We will be tested like never before."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P648612157" "Even if the people of Eltentown do not trust us, we must never waver in our protection of them."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3250950955" "If Eltentown falls, our fall will come soon after."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P2680966174" "Our goal here is not to rescue the people here, it is to keep the darkness contained. Remember that."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P2088175309" "The D.U.S.T. and the Seers are not our primary enemy here. Remember the Well. Remember what came before. There are powerful forces at work greater than Cole and his servants."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P4033725836" "The apparitions are growing in number and strength, greater than our ability to contain them. They are being facilitated by an outside force."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P2637219545" "Brothers, sisters, we have been discovered."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P2967009201" "Who imposes upon our convocation?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P1231378430" "Who is this, who disturbs the Carnival of Light?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P3617463446" "Take your darkness from this place."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P626400617" "I bring light to the darkness."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P927166232" "I am the guide, I am the light."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P3872479428" "Safety, blessings, and sanctuary to all who follow the light."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P2883026025" "Come into the light, the light is The Way."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P1249444426" "The darkness howls against the light."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P960995383" "Come to me, I am the safety of the light in a land of shadows."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P2501035107" "Do you seek sustenance and safety? I offer both."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P3023341669" "The light welcomes her servants."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P3558982498" "Do not leave the safety of the light."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P584342164" "From the shadows, it watches, and waits."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P3710089076" "In the shadows they abide."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P4059304954" "Sisters, brothers, turn from this course, it will only lead to your destruction."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P2846830169" "How could you turn against us, we are your family?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P2671083702" "You will pay for your betrayal."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P2286958616" "You are being misled, they are only using you as a weapon against us."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P987404010" "Something is controlling you, fight it! This goes against everything we've fought for!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P3960074790" "Remember yourselves! This is not who you are!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P1499788766" "They lied to you! Listen to what you're saying!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P505384659" "This is madness! Remember your oath! The light! The light protects!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P2385769336" "Stop this madness at once! The Carnival of Light are your family!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P2281501803" "Withdraw now! I do not wish to destroy you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P1897288325" "You are only serving the cause of darkness! Is this what you have become?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P3055132111" "You are no longer my brothers and sisters. You are forcing me to destroy you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_INACTIVE :
"P3432824134" "With great sadness I cast you down."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_ALERTED :
"P3916556351" "Do not interfere, this is an internal matter!"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_ALERTED :
"P997869641" "Please, help us dispatch our fallen brothers and sisters."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_ALERTED :
"P2061139063" "They have gone too far now, they are beyond redemption."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_ALERTED :
"P4199314312" "They do not represent the Carnival of Light, they have turned from the true Way."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_ALERTED :
"P764864383" "Darkness has consumed them, we must put a stop to this."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COV_ALERTED :
"P3106199148" "Do not judge us for what we must do."

// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1971155106" "Brothers, sisters, what has brought you to this?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2038009108" "Brothers, sisters, the Way of War is not our Way."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P95787747" "This path will only lead to your destruction, and the destruction of all."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3924012538" "Brothers, sisters, it is not too late to turn from your current course."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P226521305" "Brothers, sisters, we beseech you, come back with us."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1889922041" "What possesses you? This is not how we were trained."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3639001658" "Brothers, sisters, you think you are doing the will of the light, but your minds are clouded by darkness."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1208492576" "Your anger saddens me, is there no other option?"
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3149246407" "Please, must we battle? You are our family, we can find another way out of this."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3205695752" "Do not continue on this path, it leads only to death and destruction."






// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P2511941747" "I can feel their bloodlust in my bones."
// FIRSTWARD_COL_BATTLE_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P4124945685" "For too long have you sought to bring death to this world, we are here to end it."


